WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.500
windowctl. Windows, monitors, automation, draw.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.197
List every open window as a table.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.436
List monitors, with active and focused.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.350
Snap TextEdit to the left half.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.590
Quarters: Finder to the bottom right.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.783
Any split: TextEdit takes one third.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.650
Or place it at exact coordinates.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.425
Resize a window in place.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.990
Launch Calculator, then wait for it.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.136
Focus brings TextEdit to the front.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.772
Batch applies a whole layout.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.429
Screenshot just the Calculator window.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.204
Move the mouse to a found button.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.583
Click it. Calculator shows seven.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.358
Type, with focus checked first.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.597
Press key chords, like command left.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.279
Find the Format menu by name.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.425
Or find a phrase with OCR.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.525
Draw a big arrow with a sign.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.672
Box a window, or ring a point.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.236
Shapes and colours: zigzag, spiral.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.197
Numbered steps stay up with detach.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.693
Draw stop clears them all.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.211
Share your screen to a browser.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.729
On Windows, find Notepad's File menu.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:20.365
OCR works on Windows too.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:24.951
Get windowctl from npm. One binary, three platforms.
